,0.001,0.001,0.0],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"Now to your true purpose here.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.32,"end":2.784,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":6,"words":6},"large":{"start":0.32,"end":2.784,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":6,"words":6},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"Surveyor's rope is useful on a ship – it's needed to direct your sails and good for measuring speed. Plus, it can also be used to tie one thing to another thing, of course!","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":3.328,"end":13.504,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":33,"words":33},"large":{"start":3.328,"end":13.504,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":33,"words":33},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"There's plenty in this establishment. For a moment you're tempted to pinch it, but you're already wanted by the librarians. There's only so many enemies you can make before you dance a hangman's jig. Another use for rope.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":13.952,"end":26.12,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":38,"words":38},"large":{"start":13.952,"end":26.02,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":38,"words":38},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"So you enter the bar and haggle with its owner the old-fashioned way: by plonking a purse full of coins down on the counter.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":26.624,"end":34.016,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":25,"words":25},"large":{"start":26.624,"end":34.0,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":25,"words":25},"differ":false},{"i":4,"text":"\"What are these?\" the bar’s owner asks, bemused. Sigh, non-pirate folk.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":34.4,"end":41.696,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":12,"words":12},"large":{"start":34.4,"end":41.696,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":12,"words":12},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/68f92920522aa_PC%20JM2.png"}